### System paths

| Path | Owner | Purpose |
|------|-------|---------|
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/_templates/feature.md` | (template) | Canonical feature.md skeleton — copy and fill |
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/features/<module>/<feature>/feature.md` | @Analyst, @Designer, @Main, @DoDGate | The single feature design doc |
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/features/<module>/<feature>/test-cases.md` | @TestKeeper, @BugFixer (Status flips on fix) | Live test state |
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/features/<module>/<feature>/retro.md` | @BugFixer | Accumulating bug retros for this feature |
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/guidelines/libs/<lib>-<version>.md` | @CodeWriter, @BugFixer | External library documentation cache |
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/tech-debt/<module>/<slug>.md` | @CodeWriter, @BugFixer, @Reviewer | Open tech-debt entries |
| `{{VAULT_PATH}}/tech-debt/<module>/done/<slug>.md` | @Main (via `/kit-techdebt`) | Closed entries |

